  "describe": "Under the title, 'Your rating' over five 32 dp stars, three amber and two outlined, each in a 48 dp touch target (16 dp gaps); tapping the fourth lights four. Below, a 16 dp row of four and a half amber stars before '4.5 · 1,284 reviews', then 'Difficulty' beside three 24 dp stars (24 dp gaps) of which two are blue. A screen reader reads 'Your rating, 3 of 5 stars', each star '1 star' ... '5 stars', 'Average rating, 4.5 of 5 stars' and 'Difficulty, 2 of 3 stars'. Light and dark follow the theme; mono draws lit stars white (black in mono light) and empty ones grey. At 280 dp nothing wraps, at 480 the rows keep their left edge.",
